        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Titanium dioxide, production mix, at plant
This is a theoretical mix, composed of 50% TiO2 by the sulfate process and 50% by the chloride process. ;
CAS number: 013463-67-7; 
Formula: TiO2; 
Synonyms: rutil; 
UUID: 3cfb89cf-7f5e-349d-a0b2-9cae06915f41
Cradle-to-gate, includes all ancillary materials, precursors, transports and infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3cfb89cf-7f5e-349d-a0b2-9cae06915f41.xml</text>
